    "metaDescription": "THE PREVENTION OF MONEY-LAUNDERING ACT, 2002 Section 72 - Continuation of proceedings in the event of death or insolvency",
    "metaTitle": "Section 72 - THE PREVENTION OF MONEY-LAUNDERING ACT, 2002"
